<title>BRAZIL: Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</title>
<headline>Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brazilian Association of Citrus Exporters reported the following output and exports of frozen concentrated orange juice in metric tonnes 66 Brix for the period May 5-11 and the total so far in 1996/97.</p>
<p>		 May 5-11   May 6-12	  TOTAL	  TOTAL</p>
<p>		 1996/97     1995/96	  1996/97	1995/96</p>
<p> Stocks/open				  279,188.0    295,347.6</p>
<p> Production     0	     0	 1,089,679.4    973,306.9</p>
<p> Shipment    34,403.7    32,983.7   1,000,093.0    848,809.2</p>
<p> Home Marke     339.8	 464.2	14,589.7     16,648.1</p>
<p> Stocks/close				 244,444.5    261,899.7</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
</text>
